WEBVTT

00:19:59.416 --> 00:20:02.716
and as clear as day,
I could see the tumor.

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:04.801
AG: The tumor needed
to come out right away.

00:20:04.825 --> 00:20:07.966
So Joanne was rushed
to the emergency room for a craniotomy.

00:20:07.990 --> 00:20:11.096
When she woke up, she wasn't only
worried about her recovery.

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:14.241
JM: At the time, I thought
I was going to take a week off of work.

00:20:14.265 --> 00:20:15.780
I know -- major brain surgery,

00:20:15.804 --> 00:20:19.596
a week off work probably
to anyone else would seem ridiculous.

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:22.136
I was just feeling guilty
about taking that much time

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:25.116
because I had no preparation
to prep my team for this.

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:27.740
AG: To her boss
and everyone else at Accenture,

00:20:27.764 --> 00:20:29.406
that was ridiculous.

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:33.714
JM: My boss really was the one
that sort of put in my head,